{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_118_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_118_1118_p", "source_sha256": "e82dad48b3cc3bfe2c93879c00b8fc8e476a4e637ee0eccb124a9f8dbd8f866a", "ja": "そうか。\nやよいが楽しかったなら、何よりだ。", "zh": "是吗。\n弥生觉得开心，那就再好不过了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
